    "explanation": "Ingest-api picked up config revision 596, which changed ENRICHMENT_SVC_URL to port 8081 (line 176). enrichment-svc doesn't listen there, so every call is refused immediately (lines 181, 187, 192, 196) — not a timeout, and enrichment-svc itself is healthy (its routine logs continue). The ingest-gateway 503s are the symptom (lines 183, 194, 204, 212, 220, 225, 236). Red herrings: lines 45, 47 (a single geo-IP provider connection reset that succeeded on retry, minutes before onset); line 35 (a single API client being rate-limited, which is the limiter working as intended).",
